name: assistant-authored
kind: finding
is: The prose of the folder nums-go-2023 was written by an AI assistant on 2026-05-08; the folder is not a 2023 document. Its other material is only the Go code quoted from NUMS.Go, and the README adds comments to the quoted NamedCell_t struct that the Go source does not have.
