n: 3.8.3.3
name: earlier-persistence-meaning
kind: observation
is: Before 2026-05-08 ice, water and gas named a persistence state of a node. The first commit of the Living-Codex-CSharp checkout, 5fc24ba of 2025-09-09 (FRACTAL_UNFOLDING_SPEC.md line 24), has ice as essential persisted facts (atoms, deltas), water as materialized caches and prototypes, gas as derivable and transient. Its specification gained on 2025-10-07 (commit f1c4647, lines 572-575): ice persistent in SQLite or PostgreSQL, water semi-persistent materialized views, gas transient and derivable. Commit 4304a9856 of 2026-03-23 in the parent repository has the three states determine persistence.
status: observed
src: 2.16.21#571-574 2.3#commit-4304a9856
limit: Commit d91ddded2 of 2026-04-26, a spec of ice, water and gas phase states with a breath cycle, is an ancestor of main at 7eecf4da5 and was not read.
at: 2026-11-24

