n: 3.8.3.5
name: mapping-is-a-2026-05-synthesis
kind: finding
is: The mapping of the three kinds (blueprint, recipe, cell) onto the three states (ice, water, gas) is an AI assistant's synthesis of 2026-05-08 that joined two vocabularies separate until then: NUMS.Go's kinds and the Living Codex's persistence states. The uncorrected mapping in the old body's living-equation.fk derives from the folder nums-go-2023.
status: inferred
conf: mid
from: 3.8.3.1 3.8.3.2 3.8.3.3 3.8.3.4 3.8.1.3
