n: 3.8.4
name: claims-against-sources
kind: hub
is: Against NUMS.Go's source and a run, three claims of the folder fail: 13 languages enumerated, only Go with handlers; structs of one shape get different ids; globals with one initializer get different constructors. Its May build left no artifact. NUMS.Go has a cell record, a declared named slot without value. No C++ NUMS or grammar fork is on disk.
at: 2026-11-24

n: 3.8.4.5
name: cell-is-a-declared-slot
kind: observation
is: NUMS.Go has a cell record: NamedCell_t {Recipe_t; Base BlueprintNodeID_t; Name string; CTOR RecipeNodeID_t} at recipe.go lines 497-502, used in blueprint.go and emit_module.go. A cell there is a declared named slot with no run-time instance and no value. The only record holding a value is the unused Cell_t {*Blueprint_t; Value any} in reflect.go.
status: observed
src: 2.16.9#497-502 2.16.16#73 2.16.16#93 2.16.16#172-184 2.16.15#35 2.16.15#182-200 2.16.10#3-6
